sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Domain service
  participant K as Audit SDK
  participant D as Ledger DB
  participant O as Outbox worker
  participant B as Batcher
  participant C as Anchor adapter
  S->>K: critical mutation intent + correlation_id
  K->>K: redact, tenant-HMAC, canonical hashes
  K->>D: transaction(event + outbox)
  alt audit unavailable
    K-->>S: AuditUnavailableError; mutation blocked
  else committed
    D-->>K: receipt
    K-->>S: mutation may complete
    O->>D: claim pending idempotently
    O->>B: sealed event
    B->>B: ordered Merkle + manifest
    B->>C: commitment only
    Note over C: disabled unless explicit approved gate
  end
